// Developer chapter kits (work item 0043, src/developer.odin): what a
// player typically holds at the start of each chapter, handed out by the
// Developer screen's "Give the kit of chapter" buttons and by
// --chapter=<n>. One kit per chapter, in chapter order, so every chapter
// in data/quests has one; chapter 8 has no quest file yet. Items come
// from items.sjson (an unknown item stops the game at load), counts from
// 1 to 10000. What does not fit into the inventory waits for the drop
// capsule like a quest reward.
//
// Guessed generously from doc/quests.md and the chapter files, not
// balanced: each kit stays under about 40 inventory slots (machines
// stack 10, plates 50, intermediates 100).
